flowchart TD
  classDef pass fill:#d7f5df,stroke:#198754,color:#102a16
  classDef gate fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b7791f,color:#3b2f00
  classDef fail fill:#fde2e2,stroke:#b42318,color:#3b0a0a
  classDef data fill:#e7f0ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#102a43

  A[Domain executor returns dr<br/>ok · changes · outcome · ref · evidence]:::data
  B{Execute conditions?<br/>ok AND changes = 0<br/>AND verifiedNonCodeOutcome(dr)}:::gate
  C[No nonCodeOutcome<br/>ordinary no-changes result]:::fail
  D[Create in-memory nonCodeOutcome<br/>outcome · ref · nonCodeEvidence]:::pass
  E[deploy: files = changedFiles(cwd)]:::data
  F{Code changes exist?}:::gate
  G[Code deploy path]:::data
  H{nonCodeOutcome exists?}:::gate
  I[observe deploy-no-changes<br/>return { ok:false, kind:none }]:::fail
  J{Evidence is artifact-created?}:::gate
  K{PR #8731 · 2026-08-13<br/>existsSync(resolve(cwd, ref))?}:::gate
  L[observe deploy-noncode-blocked<br/>reason: artifact-created-ref-missing<br/>then deploy-no-changes]:::fail
  M[Do not treat ref as a file<br/>published-url / execution-completed]:::data
  N[observe deploy-noncode<br/>return terminal:<br/>published or executed]:::pass

  A --> B
  B -- no --> C
  B -- yes --> D --> E --> F
  F -- yes --> G
  F -- no --> H
  H -- no --> I
  H -- yes --> J
  J -- yes --> K
  K -- no --> L
  K -- yes --> N
